2021 all Suffolk’s public sector organisations have been collaborating on the delivery of the&nbsp;<a href="https://sustainablesuffolk.org.uk/suffolk-climate-emergency-plan/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" title="Link: https://sustainablesuffolk.org.uk/suffolk-climate-emergency-plan/">Suffolk Climate Emergency Plan</a>.&nbsp;</span></span></p></div><div class="flex flex-center"><figure class="brand-figure w-100"><img src="https://cdn4.sharein.com/abundance/cms/712c02b8-ba51-4dd5-8cad-001ac0bb61c2.jpg" width="800" height="450" alt="Title placeholder text" loading="lazy"> <figcaption data-content="2-143690">The council is funding greening projects across the county</figcaption></figure></div></div></div></div></section></div>
